<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Tuesday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>				 3-mths	  6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	 11.55 /11.45  11.80  /11.70   12.25 /12.10</p>
<p>BPI			 11.75 /11.45  11.95  /11.75   12.30 /12.10</p>
<p>Citibank		  11.55 /11.45  11.85  /11.75   12.20 /12.10</p>
<p>Multinational	   11.55 /11.40  11.75  /11.60   12.25</p>
<p>/12.025</p>
<p>Metrobank 11.65 /11.425 11.795 /11.60 12.25 /12.10</p>
<p>PCIBank		   11.60 /11.45  11.80  /11.70   12.25 /12.00</p>
<p>PNB			 11.50 /11.40  11.825 /11.70   12.25 /12.15</p>
<p>Solidbank		 11.55 /11.475 11.825 /11.750  12.20</p>
<p>/12.125</p>
<p>StandChart		11.60 /11.465 11.80  /11.70</p>
<p>12.175/12.025</p>
